uese-cpp is an independent implementation of a published scientific model.

Scientific model:
S. F. Vyboishchikov and A. A. Voityuk, Fast non-iterative calculation of
solvation energies for water and non-aqueous solvents, J. Comput. Chem.
42 (2021), 1184-1194. DOI: 10.1002/jcc.26531.

Surface algorithm reference:
J. L. Pascual-Ahuir, E. Silla, I. Tunon, J. Comput. Chem.
15 (1994), 1127-1138. DOI: 10.1002/jcc.540151009.

Earlier ESE/xESE methods cited by the author:
DOI: 10.1039/c9cp03010g and DOI: 10.1039/d0cp02667k.

The new C++ and test source is provided under the included MIT License.
Scientific parameter values are documented as factual data from the model
paper and the author's public uESE v1.2 executable. They are not represented
as newly fitted parameters. Supporting Information Table S1 was not obtained;
the corresponding solvent shifts were read from named runtime parameters in
the author executable. The extraction provenance is included in data/.

No original uESE/xESE executable, GEPOL Fortran source, or full journal article
is distributed in this package. Citation of the scientific authors remains
appropriate when using results from their model.
